  "startPage": "INITIAL",
  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "INITIAL",
      "choicePrompt": "",
      "background": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你刚来到一处可以歇息的地方，头部便传来一阵剧痛。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你闭上眼。再睁开时，眼前竟已是一座现代都市。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（这里是……东京？可这与之前的感觉，全然不同……为什么会这样压抑？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你环顾四周，目光忽然停在了一道人影上。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（前面那个人……是我？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/1d2ffcea95ae58043d19.png",
              "x": 1316.5,
              "y": 903.7,
              "height": 458,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（这里……难道不是我的记忆么？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你正试着分辨眼前的情形。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "信号灯转绿，“丰川祥子”随人流走向街道另一侧。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/6b31e227e4b8c9a168c8.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（无论如何，先跟上她。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/1d2ffcea95ae58043d19.png",
              "x": 1316.5,
              "y": 903.7,
              "height": 458,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 0.6
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "不久后，你跟着另一个“自己”，来到一栋大楼旁。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/85740451099301dd01de.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "CHARACTER",
              "image": "res://images/story/1d2ffcea95ae58043d19.png",
              "x": 680.8,
              "y": 896.5,
              "height": 458,
              "flipX": false,
              "opacity": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "额角传来一阵刺痛。你本能地觉得，接下来发生的事，恐怕并非自己愿意看见的。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "还没等你看清周围，视野便骤然暗了下去。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/f28f9dcd9f38fe21d0ae.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "再次睁眼时，你已置身于一个房间。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（她们……也在这里？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/98f0f6e777af796d71d7.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（……真是令人不安的气氛。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "没有人朝你看过来。你这才明白，在这里，自己只是一个旁观者。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "沉默持续了许久，直到房门被推开。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "走进来的，是另一个“你”。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/4905d755851c3996b622.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "屋内的人纷纷抬起头，目光落在了她身上。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "亚麻色长发的少女转过身，快步迎了上去。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "小祥！",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/83f849333c786ff2ff64.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（……诶？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "太好了，你终于来了。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/a98f22dd106faa2c7b8a.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（……她的声音，原本是这样的吗？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "你全身都湿透了，没事吧？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/2a909acf523e5fd89eb6.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "你没有来学校上课，给你发消息也不回。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/8cc61505904cb20c1793.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "亚麻色长发的少女正要递出手帕，另一个“你”却忽然抓住了她的手腕。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/ad3ff743bb64b6a79cc2.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "“丰川祥子”",
          "text": "我今天是来说一件事的。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/6b8e31e30ff6c34e9c9a.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "“丰川祥子”",
          "text": "我要……退出 CRYCHIC。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/4b1324a8b781e246ae7f.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（CRYCHIC……是这支乐队的名字么？）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "话音落下，房间里愈发沉寂。那个喜欢熊猫的少女，眉头也皱得更紧了。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/fb1661264218f721a64a.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "等一下，先坐下再说吧？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "另一个“你”轻轻摇头，拒绝了她的提议。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/a2cf6c8d6909959f8626.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "不能告诉我们吗？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "为什么？出什么事了吗？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "还是说……是我们的缘故？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "如果是我们的问题，我们会改的。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "“丰川祥子”",
          "text": "是我自己的问题。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/30fc8163885ff7ef442a.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "为什么？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/56e5ad56326e53ee7d96.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "之前的演出不是很开心吗？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "亚麻色长发的少女",
          "text": "你也说过，还想再参加吧？",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "“丰川祥子”",
          "text": "我没说。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（不……你明明说过的。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "脑海中的胀痛愈发强烈。随着她们的交谈，几段久远的画面逐渐浮现。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "高松灯",
          "text": "我们是 CRYCHIC。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/147d563dd41922d753b9.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "高松灯",
          "text": "请听——",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "高松灯",
          "text": "《春日影》。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/a57e42d64be5edf5c63f.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "熟悉的旋律响起。你与她们共度的时光，随之涌回脑海。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/55bc8a35f517a9be44ea.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "她们的名字，一起组建乐队的日子，还有……另一个“你”接下来会做的事。你终于都想起来了。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你想做些什么，却也清楚：作为旁观者，你无法改变这一切。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（大家……请再等一等。我一定会回来的。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/55bc8a35f517a9be44ea.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "视野开始模糊。留给你的时间，到此为止了。",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "res://images/story/94f82a588fa5f0bb389a.png",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "thought",
          "speaker": "丰川祥子",
          "text": "（还有你，“高我”……无论你在哪里，我都会找到你。）",
          "portrait": "",
          "background": "",
          "portraitLayout": null,
          "characters": null
        }
      ],
